    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "By means of the instant application, the applicant has sought the following main relief:-\n\"(i) To quash entire proceedings of Complaint Case No. 1098 of 2012 under section 498A/323/504/506 I.P.C. P.S. Sarojini Nagar Lucknow (Smt. Poonam Verma Versus Anil Kumar Vimal and others) at present pending in the Court of learned Civil Judge (J.D.)/ F.T.C. Offences against Woman, Lucknow in the interest of justice.\"\nThe aforesaid relief has been sought on the basis of the fact that the parties have settled their matrimonial dispute amicably outside of the Court and in terms of the settlement arrived in between the parties.\nThe Criminal Case No. 202 of 2014 (Km. Anushka Vs. Anil Kumar Vimal) has already been decided.\nIn this regard reference has been made in page 50 of the paper book, which is the copy of the order dated 07.02.2024 passed in Criminal Case No. 202 of 2014.",
