      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "It is also sated that in terms of the compromise annexed at page 51 of the paper book filed in Criminal Case No. 202 of 2014 as also the copy of cheque annexed at page 55 of the paper book would indicate that the amount settled between the parties has already been paid by the applicant no. 1.",
