      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "It is also stated that subsequent to the order dated 07.02.2024 based upon the settlement between the parties, the complaint case no. 324 of 2014 under Section 12 of the D.V. Act has also been decided vide order dated 14.02.2025 and opposite party no. 2 has also preferred an application dated 20.04.2024 duly supported by affidavit, where withdrawal of the complaint case no. 1098 of 2012 under Section 498-A, 323, 504, 506 of IPC has been filed.\nOpposite party no. 2 is present before this Court who has been identified by Sri Rahul Srivastava says that the proceedings be quashed based upon the compromise.",
